window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From USA TODAY Bestselling Author Willow Winters comes a fast paced and sizzling fated mates standalone romance in her best selling paranormal world.</b><br> <br> Fate never prepared me for seeing my mate with the claiming mark of my enemy.<br> <br> She doesn’t know she’s my mate. She doesn’t feel the burning pull between us. The desperate need to love and be loved by me as I feel raging inside me.<br> <br> None of this should have happened this way.<br> <br> I don’t know how she came to be his, but I’ll slowly torture him if his claim has broken my mate’s ability to feel our bond.</p> <p>The war has already begun and when the dust settles she will be mine.<br> <br> I can’t imagine an existence without her … and my greatest fear is that it’s all too late.</p> <p><i>Broken Fate is a complete standalone. You can listen to it without listening to anything else or enjoy it before or after the Wounded Kiss trilogy.</i></p>"; 
